WEBVTT

00:11:29.625 --> 00:11:34.280
Nyie wengine, mtakua wakubwa na mtapata
watoto bilioni mbili.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.888
Kisha wazee watakufa.

00:11:36.888 --> 00:11:40.926
Wengine watakua wakubwa na kupata watoto
bilioni mbili.

00:11:40.926 --> 00:11:46.695
Na tena wazee watakufa na mtapata watoto
bilioni mbili.

00:11:46.695 --> 00:11:48.949
(Makofi)

00:11:48.949 --> 00:11:52.582
Hii ni ujazo mkubwa.

00:11:52.582 --> 00:11:55.354
Haiepukiki.

00:11:55.354 --> 00:11:58.000
Na unaona kua hili ongezeko lilitokea

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:02.803
bila maisha kua marefu na bila kuongeza
watoto?